<title>USA: Consolidated Eco-Systems names CFO.</title>
<headline>Consolidated Eco-Systems names CFO.</headline>
<dateline>JACKSON, Miss. 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Consolidated Eco-Systems Inc, formerly Exsorbet Industries Inc, said Tuesday it had chosen Edward Penick Jr. to be its chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Penick was a founding principal and has served as chairman of Consolidated Environmental Services Inc, Consolidated Eco-Systems's remediation subsidiary.</p>
<p>He has been a vice president of Consolidated Eco-Systems since April 1996.</p>
<p>Consolidated Eco-Systems is a diversified technical and industrial service company.</p>
